  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "env-simx-pods",
      "label": "SimX Product Pods",
      "description": "Product organization by functional pod.",
      "type": "environment",
      "category": "environment",
      "visibility": "internal",
      "parentId": null,
      "content": "## Overview\n\nSimX product engineering and content organized into functional pods, each with defined responsibilities, roles, and initiatives.\n\n### Cross-cutting roles\n\n| Role | Focus |\n|------|-------|\n| **Tech Lead** | Technical direction, quality, alignment with product goals |\n| **Product Manager** | End-to-end product discovery, prioritization, and delivery |\n| **Principal TPM** | Clarity and execution across complex technical initiatives (Kim) |\n\n### Shared capacity\n\nSome team members split time across pods — e.g. Jason (50% Unity Platform / 50% Context), Jim (50% Unity Platform / 50% Platform Ops), Nora (25% AutoMod / 75% Context)."
    },
    {
      "id": "env-autonomous-moderation",
      "label": "Autonomous Moderation Products",
      "description": "AI Assistant and autonomous-ready simulation capabilities.",
      "type": "pod-automod",
      "category": "environment",
      "visibility": "both",
      "parentId": "env-simx-pods",
      "content": "## Responsibilities\n\n- Launch AI Assistant to production\n- Expand functionality for autonomous-ready simulations (learner orientation, debrief reports)\n\n### Roles\n\n| Role | Person |\n|------|--------|\n| Product Manager | Tola |\n| Tech Lead | Brett |\n| Designer | Nora (25%) |\n| Unity Developer | Ryan |"
    },
    {
      "id": "app-automod-technology",
